// AWS S3 Bucket ACL Changed to Public  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1537
// Detects changes to a bucket ACL (PutBucketAcl) that grant access to AllUsers/AuthenticatedUsers (public). Inspect…
// False positives: Rare legitimate public-content buckets (should use explicit, reviewed policy).
// Source: rules/exfiltration/s3-put-bucket-acl-public.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where eventName=="PutBucketAcl" and eventSource=="s3.amazonaws.com"
